option.vanillaAoLift=Vanilla AO Lift
option.vanillaAoLift.comment=Lifts the darkest vanilla AO shadows toward flat lighting. Higher = shallower, more washed-out crevices; 0 = full-depth vanilla AO.
option.atmosphereRainDesaturation=Atmosphere Rain Desaturation
option.atmosphereRainDesaturation.comment=Desaturates the atmosphere during rain, making for colder looking rain
option.atmosphereRainDesaturationIntensity=Desaturation Intensity
option.atmosphereRainDesaturationIntensity.comment=How much the sky and the haze lose their colour while it rains. Higher values give rainy weather a flatter, greyer look.
